Package: RGenEDA
Title: Genomic Exploratory Data Analysis
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R:
    person("Michael", "Martinez", , "f007qps@dartmouth.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a unified and reproducible framework for performing
    genomic exploratory data analysis (EDA). Highly repetitive functions and
    analyses have been collated into an easy-to-use S4 object that produces
    quick results and customizable visualizations to assess variation in your
    data. See <https://github.com/mikemartinez99/RGenEDA>.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/mikemartinez99/RGenEDA,
    https://mikemartinez99.github.io/RGenEDA/
BugReports: https://github.com/mikemartinez99/RGenEDA/issues
